{"id":"109b0b8d7ee4cec9","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-wkl0.md","title":"Weak König's Lemma","display":"df-wkl0 — Weak König's Lemma","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-wkl0","aliases":["72-df-wkl0"],"display":"df-wkl0 — Weak König's Lemma","depends_on":["[[72-df-base-system]]","[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print271–273/PDF283–285; definitions supplemented by Simpson, SOSOA 2nd ed., §§I.2–I.11, https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-wkl0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-wkl0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-wkl0 — Weak König's Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" href=\"?note=8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" title=\"72-df-base-system\">72-df-base-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print271–273/PDF283–285; definitions supplemented by Simpson, SOSOA 2nd ed., §§I.2–I.11, <a href=\"https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>有限二进制串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=(s_0,\\ldots,s_{n-1})\">\\(s=(s_0,\\ldots,s_{n-1})\\)</span> 的代码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(s):=2^n-1+\\sum_{i&lt;n}s_i2^i\">\\(c(s):=2^n-1+\\sum_{i&lt;n}s_i2^i\\)</span>，这是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的双射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(c(s)):=n\">\\(\\ell(c(s)):=n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bit}(c(s),i):=s_i\">\\(\\operatorname{bit}(c(s),i):=s_i\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pref}(c(s),k):=c(s\\restriction k)\">\\(\\operatorname{pref}(c(s),k):=c(s\\restriction k)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\le n\">\\(k\\le n\\)</span>），越界取0；这些PR函数以保守定义使用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,X\">\\(T,X\\)</span> 是集变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RCA}_0\">\\(\\mathsf{RCA}_0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" href=\"?note=8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97\" title=\"72-df-base-system\">72-df-base-system</a>。以下均为可经PR定义消去的对象公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)&amp;:=\\forall s\\,(s\\in T\\to\\forall k\\le\\ell(s)\\ (\\operatorname{pref}(s,k)\\in T)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inf}_2(T)&amp;:=\\forall n\\exists s\\,(s\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)&amp;:=\\forall n\\exists s\\,[s\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n\\land\\forall i&lt;n(\\operatorname{bit}(s,i)=1\\leftrightarrow i\\in X)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}&amp;:=\\forall T[(\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\\operatorname{Inf}_2(T))\\to\\exists X\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}_0&amp;:=\\mathsf{RCA}_0\\cup\\{\\mathsf{WKL}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)&amp;:=\\forall s\\,(s\\in T\\to\\forall k\\le\\ell(s)\\ (\\operatorname{pref}(s,k)\\in T)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inf}_2(T)&amp;:=\\forall n\\exists s\\,(s\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)&amp;:=\\forall n\\exists s\\,[s\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n\\land\\forall i&lt;n(\\operatorname{bit}(s,i)=1\\leftrightarrow i\\in X)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}&amp;:=\\forall T[(\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\\operatorname{Inf}_2(T))\\to\\exists X\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}_0&amp;:=\\mathsf{RCA}_0\\cup\\{\\mathsf{WKL}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原来的∀T⊆2^{&lt;N}量化是元理论集合量化；现在WKL是明确的L2句子。每个X的特征位确定唯一长度n串，故Branch条件保证前缀相容。Tree前提不可省略：每层存在节点本身不保证一条共同路径。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-base-system","status":"resolved","id":"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-base-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-base-system","status":"resolved","id":"8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,X$ 是集变量，$\\mathsf{RCA}_0$ 见 [[72-df-base-system]]。以下均为可经PR定义消去的对象公式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s=(s_0,\\ldots,s_{n-1})","display":false},{"tex":"c(s):=2^n-1+\\sum_{i<n}s_i2^i","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(c(s)):=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bit}(c(s),i):=s_i","display":false},{"tex":"i<n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pref}(c(s),k):=c(s\\restriction k)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"T,X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RCA}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)&:=\\forall s\\,(s\\in T\\to\\forall k\\le\\ell(s)\\ (\\operatorname{pref}(s,k)\\in T)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inf}_2(T)&:=\\forall n\\exists s\\,(s\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)&:=\\forall n\\exists s\\,[s\\in T\\land\\ell(s)=n\\land\\forall i<n(\\operatorname{bit}(s,i)=1\\leftrightarrow i\\in X)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}&:=\\forall T[(\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\\operatorname{Inf}_2(T))\\to\\exists X\\operatorname{Branch}_2(X,T)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{WKL}_0&:=\\mathsf{RCA}_0\\cup\\{\\mathsf{WKL}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1931,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-wkl0|df-wkl0 — Weak König's Lemma]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-wkl0|df-wkl0 — Weak König's Lemma]]"},{"id":"ca4d81197c96530e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{RCA}_0,\\mathsf{WKL}_0,\\mathsf{ACA}_0,\\mathsf{PA}$ 是 [[72-df-base-system]]、[[72-df-wkl0]]、[[72-df-aca0]]、[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]] 的公理句集合；$\\vdash_2$ 是 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的实际有限两类变量Hilbert推导。"},{"id":"a370c651bd39d70c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["8eb9c6f1fa4b9c97","1a814f5220a079de"]}